{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "6dab79b0-167d-4aed-8d7e-66d0d7aeceb6",
    "name": "Go Web API - Complete Collection v2",
    "description": "# Go Web API - Modular REST API\n\n## Environment Setup\n\n**Variables Required:**\n- `base_url`: http://localhost:8080/api/v1\n- `token`: (auto-set on login)\n- `refresh_token`: (auto-set on login)\n- `user_id`: (auto-set on login)\n- `tenant_slug`: acme6\n- `product_id`: (auto-set on product create)\n- `customer_id`: (auto-set on customer create)\n- `sales_order_id`: (auto-set on order create)\n\n## Modules\n\n- **Auth**: Authentication & session management (OTP, Login, Register, Password Reset)\n- **Users**: User CRUD (admin only)\n- **Tenants**: Multi-tenant management\n- **Inventory**: Product management, variants, stock tracking\n- **Sales**: Customer management, sales orders\n- **Tracking**: GPS tracking for transport companies\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. Set `base_url` in environment\n2. Run `Auth > Login` to get tokens\n3. Tokens auto-save to environment\n4. All protected endpoints auto-refresh on 401",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "1058220"
  },
